<h1>LINGVOKULTUROLOGIYA</h1>
<h2>fanidan ISHCHI O'QUV DASTURI</h2>
<br>
<table>
<tr><td><b>Bilim sohasi:</b></td><td>100000 — Gumanitar fanlar</td></tr>
<tr><td><b>Ta'lim yo'nalishi:</b></td><td>5111300 — Ona tili va adabiyot (o'zbek tili)</td></tr>
<tr><td><b>Fan turi:</b></td><td>Mutaxassislik fani</td></tr>
<tr><td><b>Kredit soni:</b></td><td>4 kredit</td></tr>
<tr><td><b>Jami soatlar:</b></td><td>180 soat</td></tr>
<tr><td><b>Ma'ruza:</b></td><td>36 soat</td></tr>
<tr><td><b>Amaliy mashg'ulot:</b></td><td>36 soat</td></tr>
